{"id":"4e0030b331726af9","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step.md","title":"无穷项的带位置归约","display":"df-infinitary-rewrite-step — 无穷项的带位置归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step","aliases":["56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step"],"display":"df-infinitary-rewrite-step — 无穷项的带位置归约","depends_on":["[[56-df-infinite-term]]","[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 12.2.2, printed p671; introductory finite-rule restriction on p670 noted","source_ocr_block":"691–692","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-rewrite-step — 无穷项的带位置归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 12.2.2, printed p671; introductory finite-rule restriction on p670 noted"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"691–692"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W=\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a> 已定义的有限树子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in T^\\infty\">\\(s,t,u\\in T^\\infty\\)</span>；子项与子树替换的参数域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\)</span>。本节点允许右部无穷、左部有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的每条规则满足断言中的条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T^\\infty\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T^\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\upharpoonright D\">\\(t\\upharpoonright D\\)</span> 表示函数限制。下列子项、替换和子树替换均在树编码上定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{(l,r)\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\times T^\\infty:l(\\epsilon)\\in F\\land\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(r)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(l)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{(l,r)\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\times T^\\infty:l(\\epsilon)\\in F\\land\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(r)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(l)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t|_p\\coloneqq\\{(q,t(pq)):pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\},\\qquad t[u]_p\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):p\\npreceq q\\})\\cup\\{(pq,u(q)):q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(u)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t|_p\\coloneqq\\{(q,t(pq)):pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\},\\qquad t[u]_p\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):p\\npreceq q\\})\\cup\\{(pq,u(q)):q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(u)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):t(p)\\in F\\})\\cup\\{(pq,\\sigma(t(p))(q)):p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),t(p)\\in\\mathcal V,q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(\\sigma(t(p)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\sigma\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):t(p)\\in F\\})\\cup\\{(pq,\\sigma(t(p))(q)):p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),t(p)\\in\\mathcal V,q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(\\sigma(t(p)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(s)\\land\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathcal V}\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(s)\\land\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathcal V}\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in W\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in W\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据 Definition 12.2.2（印刷 p671，OCR 页块692）的明确规则格式：有限左部、允许无穷右部。p670 的导入段另说将使用有限两侧规则；本节点不把这段叙述偷换成定义限制，并显式区分形式定义与常用有限规则子类。并集中的替换片段无冲突，因为变量节点是互不为前缀的叶子。此处仅定义一步，未宣称任意正交 iTRS 具有无穷合流性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-infinite-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"98838138a402c043","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$、$W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}$。令 $T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 已定义的有限树子集。$s,t,u\\in T^\\infty$；子项与子树替换的参数域是 $p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)$。本节点允许右部无穷、左部有限；$R$ 的每条规则满足断言中的条件。$\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T^\\infty$；$t\\upharpoonright D$ 表示函数限制。下列子项、替换和子树替换均在树编码上定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\mathbb N_{>0}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u\\in T^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathcal V\\to T^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"t\\upharpoonright D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\{(l,r)\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\times T^\\infty:l(\\epsilon)\\in F\\land\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(r)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_\\infty(l)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq\\mathrm{IRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"t|_p\\coloneqq\\{(q,t(pq)):pq\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t)\\},\\qquad t[u]_p\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):p\\npreceq q\\})\\cup\\{(pq,u(q)):q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(u)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"t\\sigma\\coloneqq(t\\upharpoonright\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t):t(p)\\in F\\})\\cup\\{(pq,\\sigma(t(p))(q)):p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(t),t(p)\\in\\mathcal V,q\\in\\mathrm{dom}(\\sigma(t(p)))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t)\\Longleftrightarrow p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(s)\\land\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathcal V}\\;(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p).","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_R^\\infty t\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists p\\in W\\;\\mathrm{Step}_R(s,p,t).","display":true}],"bytes":2456,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15a2e6c82927d21a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取互异函数符号 $A,C$，$\\Sigma=(\\{A,C\\},\\{(A,1),(C,1)\\})$；$\\mathcal V$ 为与它们不交的变量集，$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$ 且 $x\\ne y$。使用 [[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step]] 的位置树编码、$\\mathrm{Step}_R$ 和 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]] 的序列谓词。$\\epsilon=()$，$\\cdot$ 为位置串连接，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$w_n$ 按自然数递归。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-infinitary-rewrite-step.md]]"}],"outgoing":["ef3a31528875d9d3","98838138a402c043"]}